@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title VF2 subgraph-isomorphism search (Cordella et al. 2004)
[*] --> Empty : initial state
state Empty #F1F3F5 : mapping = {}
Empty --> Candidate : select (n, m)\nfrom terminal sets
state Candidate #FFF3BF : trial pair (n, m)
Candidate --> Extended : is_feasible(n, m)\nkinds + edges consistent
Candidate --> Backtrack : infeasible
state Extended #D3F9D8 : push_mapping(n, m)
Extended --> Complete : |mapping| = |pattern|
Extended --> Candidate : recurse / extend
state Backtrack #FFE3E3 : pop_mapping
Backtrack --> Candidate : restore exact prior state
state Complete #C3FAE8 : record embedding
Complete --> [*]
note bottom of Backtrack
  Pop-order fix (P7b): an explicit push-order
  stack of frames restores the mapping AND the
  terminal sets exactly on backtrack.
end note
@enduml
